cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, or parts of its code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "NDM Password Generator"
abstract: >-
  A single-file, dependency-free Python command-line generator of high-entropy
  passwords that are safe for mobile keyboards, URLs, shell and config files.
  Randomness comes from the OS CSPRNG; every password is reported with its exact
  entropy and a strength label, and a target strength can be requested instead of
  a length.
